description "Imperial Jumptrooper

Jetpack soldiers with a variety of suppression tools and explosives.

^2Weaponry:
- Jumptrooper Melee
-- Jet Tackle only
-- 400% more damage
-- 90% more knockback
- PLX-2M Rocket Launcher (6)
-- Staggers/pushes on det
-- 15% more velocity
-- 50% slower reload
- Frag Grenade (1)

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Strength (1)
- Blast Armor
- Assemble (3)
- No Gunbash
- 50% slower skill cooldown
- 25% less knockback taken

^3Abilities:
- Quick Throw (1) ^3[CS3]
- Jetpack"